<title>FRANCE: Algerian publishing firm posts profit.</title>
<headline>Algerian publishing firm posts profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's main book publishing firm, the state-owned Entreprise Nationale des Arts Graphiques, made a 24.08 million dinars ($430,000) profit in 1996, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The agency gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>($1 = 56 dinars)</p>
</text>
